  {
   "id": "insurmountable-133846@patch-2021-08-04",
   "gameId": "insurmountable-133846",
   "displayName": "Announcements and Community Patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-08-04T10:12:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings mountaineers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "some time has passed since our big 1.2 patch, in which we implemented many of your suggestions and wishes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now we are back with an announcement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Already at the end of this month another patch will be released.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Among other things, this \"community\" patch will include further Quality of Life features,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "like the use of items and skills in events and a hotkey system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main focus of this patch, however, are the new Insurmountable Steam Community items that we will be adding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This means that you will be able to collect Steam Trading Cards by playing Insurmountable, craft badges, and acquire awesome mountain and Mountaineer inspired Profile Wallpapers and Emoticons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "But there is one more announcement",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are currently working on a really HUGE patch with full force.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unfortunately we can't tell you anything about the patch itself or its release date yet.ːsteamsadː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "However, you can look forward to the future of Insurmountable with the same confidence as we do.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are wondering what else we have been up to in the last months, you can have a look at our 2-player coop-game \"Gelly Break Deluxe\", which will be released on August 12th:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We as indies would be very happy about a Wishlist entry.ːsteamhappyːːsteamhappyːːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Of course we will participate at the digital Gamescom again this year and show Insurmountable at the IndieArenaBooth.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More news about this will follow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it for now with this announcement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Good Climbing,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Insurmountable Development Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
