  {
   "id": "insurmountable-133846@1.2",
   "gameId": "insurmountable-133846",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-05-26T16:32:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Mountaineers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.2 is finally here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We tried to implement as many suggestions of you guys as possible into this. We added new content and a Metagame Progression, improved the camera, worked on the Map Generation, added Quality of Life Features such as hiding the HUD and did some balancing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will also reset the Leaderboards when the Patch comes out, and honor the Top 10 of Patch 1.1 in each difficulty with a special post in the coming days.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since we are adding Content for the Map you will not be able to continue your current Ascent on Version 1.2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you still want to finish your sweet sweet run from Version 1.1.2, you can do that by following the instruction in this post:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Map Generation",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Increased Variety on the first Mountain",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed smaller map bugs on all Mountains",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked placement of dangerous terrain to help with balancing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Camera improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New Freelook Mode (triggered by holding a Key, default: \"R\") to help look around in constricted spaces",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overall tweaks to the Camera (less clipping, improved zooming behaviour when looking around)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Content",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "17 new regular Events",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4 new \"Trader\" Events (with multiple trade Offerings per Trader)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "9 new Items (4 Consumables, 5 pieces of Equipment)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "6 new Character Skills (see Metagame/Progression)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Metagame/Progression",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "When selecting a character, the player now choses 1 out of up to 3 unlockable Skills to start the run with",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Skills are unlocked by successfully climbing the first and second Mountain (even if you don't complete the run afterwards)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "UI/Quality of Life",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "HUD can be hidden (default key: \"H\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved communication as to when UI screens can/cannot be accessed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved hover preview on what active skills will do when you use them",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Smaller Tweaks to UI and hover information",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Sleeping without a tent can now cause critical events",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Smaller tweaks to skills and items: And many bugfixes!: If you want to know the balancing Details just hover over the censored parts down below.: Good Climbing,: The Insurmountable Development Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Skills",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Night Climber",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Night Owl\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Experience gain Bonus during the Night 50% -> 60%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Warmup\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Energy Cost 25 -> 15",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"One with the Stars\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Level 1: Energy Cost reduction during the Night 20% -> 25%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
